    "event_description": "<p data-start=\"157\" data-end=\"463\">From Thursday to Sunday, Riverside Market turns up the volume and sets the vibe with Riverside DJs&nbsp;<span>&ndash;</span> a free-to-attend celebration of music, movement, and riverside energy. Grab a drink and let the beats roll as local DJs spin everything from laid-back grooves to dance-floor bangers every Thursday and Friday 6-10pm, and every Saturday 3-10pm.&nbsp;</p>\n<p data-start=\"361\" data-end=\"528\">Whether you&rsquo;re catching up with friends, easing into the evening, or just vibing solo, the soundtrack&rsquo;s sorted <span>&ndash;</span> and the river&rsquo;s right there with the perfect backdrop.</p>\n<p data-start=\"530\" data-end=\"610\">No tickets. No fuss. Just good music, good food, and&nbsp;a great atmosphere.</p>",
