    "event_description": "<p data-start=\"350\" data-end=\"472\">Feeling strategic? Swing by reception any time, any day, sign out a chess set, and take your game to the next level &ndash; literally. With Chess for Hire, you can battle it out riverside, overlooking the water while snacking on your choice of bites and drinks from over 10 kitchens and bars at Riverside Market. Whether you're a grandmaster or just learning how the knight <em data-start=\"408\" data-end=\"418\">actually</em> moves, it&rsquo;s the perfect way to kill time without losing your king. No pressure &ndash; it&rsquo;s your move.</p>\n<p data-start=\"350\" data-end=\"472\">So go ahead &ndash; challenge a friend, stir up a rivalry, or just enjoy a quiet game by the river.<br data-start=\"1234\" data-end=\"1237\" /><em data-start=\"1240\" data-end=\"1281\"></em></p>\n<p data-start=\"350\" data-end=\"472\"><em data-start=\"1240\" data-end=\"1281\">Available at Kiss the Hippo.&nbsp; It's your move.</em></p>",
