    "event_description": "<p>Think you&rsquo;ve got what it takes to be crowned quiz champions? Join us at Riverside Market for a fun-filled evening of trivia hosted by <em>The Quiz Team</em>.</p>\n<p>Put your knowledge to the test and compete for some great prizes: a &pound;50 bar tab for the winners, and a bottle of Mionetto for the runners-up.</p>\n<p>To keep you fuelled throughout the night, we&rsquo;ll be serving up a special pizza and pitcher deal - perfect for sharing with your team. So grab your mates, grab a slice, and get stuck into the quiz!</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Pizza Deal:</p>\n<p>20 inch pizza of your choice with a pitcher or larger of cider for &pound;40</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Variety of food available to purchase in Riverside Market before, during and after the event.</p>\n<p><span>Please note. During the Winter months, the Bishops Park gate to Fulham Pier will be closed from 6.30pm, and Bishop&rsquo;s Park itself will close at 7pm.&nbsp;</span><span data-olk-copy-source=\"MessageBody\">Those joining us for events should use the Thames Path pathway from Stevenage Road to access Fulham Pier. Use what3words &lsquo;stars.boat.faster&rsquo; to guide you to the pathway.</span></p>",
