    "event_title": "Reset & Rise Wellness Retreat with PBB Pilates ",
    "event_description": "<p><br /></p>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><span fontscheme=\"2\">Start your new year with intention and inspiration at our immersive half-day wellness retreat, presented in partnership with<strong> PBB Pilates. </strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\" fontscheme-block=\"2\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><span fontscheme=\"2\">We are thrilled to be joined by </span><strong fontscheme=\"2\">Paola Di Lanzo (PBB Pilates)</strong><span fontscheme=\"2\">, </span><strong fontscheme=\"2\">Joseph (Urmi Sounds)</strong><span fontscheme=\"2\">, </span><strong fontscheme=\"2\"><strong fontscheme=\"2\">Raoul Rechnitz (Picture of Health Nutrition),&nbsp;</strong></strong>\n<p><strong>Jenny Elliott</strong>&nbsp;<strong>(F45 Fulham Studio)</strong>&nbsp;<span fontscheme=\"2\">and </span><strong fontscheme=\"2\">Krystal Roxx</strong><span fontscheme=\"2\"> each bringing their own unique expertise and energy to the experience.</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\" fontscheme-block=\"2\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><span fontscheme=\"2\">Designed to leave you feeling balanced, grounded and deeply connected this energising experience weaves together movement, mindfulness and community to create a truly transformative morning.</span></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\" fontscheme-block=\"2\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><span fontscheme=\"2\">You&rsquo;ll move through uplifting physical practice, unwind with restorative sound healing and engage in a meaningful mindfulness-focused panel discussion. Throughout the morning, leading wellness and nutrition experts will spark reflection, clarity and motivation through thoughtful conversation and practical insights.</span></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\" fontscheme-block=\"2\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><span fontscheme=\"2\">Whether you&rsquo;re seeking a full reset, a gentle recharge or simply a moment of space and stillness this retreat offers the ideal environment to nurture both body and mind. </span></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\" fontscheme-block=\"2\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><span fontscheme=\"2\">Surrounded by a like-minded community, you&rsquo;ll share challenges, build meaningful connections and step back into your day feeling refreshed, inspired and truly supported.</span></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><br /><span fontscheme=\"2\"></span></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><span fontscheme=\"2\">Join us and start the year exactly as you mean to go on.</span></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\" fontscheme-block=\"2\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><strong fontscheme=\"2\"><em>Each participant will also receive a beautifully curated goodie bag packed with wellness treats worth &pound;50 and includes a free ticket to Krystal Roxx's Sober Rave.</em></strong></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\" bold-block=\"true\" fontscheme-block=\"2\" italic-block=\"true\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><strong fontscheme=\"2\"><u class=\"ql-und\">What to Expect</u></strong></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\" bold-block=\"true\" fontscheme-block=\"2\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><strong fontscheme=\"2\">09:30am &ndash; 10:00am | Arrival &amp; Welcome</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><span fontscheme=\"2\">Enjoy herbal tea or kombucha with light, nourishing snacks as you settle in. Meet your facilitators and get an introduction to the day ahead.</span></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\" fontscheme-block=\"2\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><strong fontscheme=\"2\">10:00am &ndash; 10:50am | Pilates with PBB Pilates</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><span fontscheme=\"2\">Wake up your body and energise your morning with a guided Pilates session suitable for all levels.</span></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\" fontscheme-block=\"2\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><strong fontscheme=\"2\">11:00am &ndash; 11:40am | Panel Discussion: Reset, Rebalance &amp; Connect</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><span fontscheme=\"2\">Discover practical tips for nourishing your energy through lifestyle, mindfulness and gut support in this engaging conversation.</span></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\" fontscheme-block=\"2\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><strong fontscheme=\"2\">11:45am &ndash; 12:30pm | Guided Sound Healing</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><span fontscheme=\"2\">Relax, release and reconnect during a calming guided sound healing session.</span></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\" fontscheme-block=\"2\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><strong fontscheme=\"2\">12:30pm &ndash; 1:00pm | Lunch Break</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><span fontscheme=\"2\">Refuel with a light, wholesome lunch.</span></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\" fontscheme-block=\"2\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><strong fontscheme=\"2\">2:00pm &ndash; 4:30pm | Sober Rave with Krystal Roxx</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><span fontscheme=\"2\">Move, dance and celebrate in a high-energy, alcohol-free rave to close your wellness retreat on a joyful note.</span></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><span fontscheme=\"2\"></span><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><span fontscheme=\"2\">Buy tickets <a href=\"https://clients.mindbodyonline.com/classic/ws?studioid=43753&amp;stype=-7&amp;sTG=95&amp;sVT=2223&amp;sView=day&amp;sLoc=1&amp;date=01/18/26\">HERE</a>&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\" fontscheme-block=\"2\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\" bold-block=\"true\" fontscheme-block=\"2\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><strong fontscheme=\"2\">About Paola Di Lanzo: </strong></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\" bold-block=\"true\" fontscheme-block=\"2\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><span fontscheme=\"2\">Paola is the creator of the &ldquo;infamous&rdquo; PBB Method. Paola has always had a passion for health and fitness and began her career in fitness three decades ago in Australia. Her passion for movement led her to study Pilates at the Pilates Institute in 2002. Fifteen years ago, she revolutionised the fitness industry in London by developing her unique PBB Method before the fitness explosion began in the UK. Paola wanted to create an edge and fun to the traditional ways of teaching Pilate, Barre and Yoga. She is a true trailblazer with her fusions and style, leading many in the industry to flock to her for inspiration when she first came onto the London fitness scene. Paola has shaped many well-known bodies and &ldquo;derri&egrave;re&rsquo;s&rdquo; in South West London within her own studios and several private clubs and studios across London. It&rsquo;s not just a brand and method - it&rsquo;s a community.</span></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\" fontscheme-block=\"2\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><span fontscheme=\"2\">&ldquo;PBB is more than just a method. I designed my method to not only deliver an efficient workout but to also build a strong, supportive community. The PBB Method is here to enhance and elevate you to be the very best version of yourself!&rdquo;</span></div>\n</div>",
