    "event_title": "Glow From Within: Facial Massage Workshop",
    "event_description": "<p><br /></p>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><span fontscheme=\"2\">Discover the secrets to a natural, radiant glow in this hands-on facial massage workshop with</span><strong fontscheme=\"1\"> expert facialist Charlotte Habibi</strong><span fontscheme=\"1\">. Learn how to lift and tone your facial muscles, boost circulation and release tension for a refreshed, luminous look.</span></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\" fontscheme-block=\"1\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><strong fontscheme=\"1\">What you&rsquo;ll learn:</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\" bold-block=\"true\" fontscheme-block=\"1\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><span fontscheme=\"1\">- How your facial muscles, skin, blood flow and fascia shape your features and affect your skin&rsquo;s appearance.</span></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\" fontscheme-block=\"1\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><span fontscheme=\"1\">- Techniques to strengthen dormant muscles and relax overactive ones.</span></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\" fontscheme-block=\"1\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><span fontscheme=\"1\">- A simple, daily massage ritual to incorporate into your skincare routine.</span></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\" fontscheme-block=\"1\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><strong fontscheme=\"1\">What to bring:</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\" bold-block=\"true\" fontscheme-block=\"1\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><span fontscheme=\"1\">- A facial oil you&rsquo;re comfortable using (we&rsquo;ll also provide one if needed).</span></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\" fontscheme-block=\"1\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><span fontscheme=\"1\">- A hair tie or headband.</span></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\" fontscheme-block=\"1\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><span fontscheme=\"1\">- A top that gives access to your neck and d&eacute;colletage, as we&rsquo;ll be working into the neck and shoulders.</span></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\" bold-block=\"true\" fontscheme-block=\"1\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><strong fontscheme=\"1\">Please note: </strong><span fontscheme=\"1\">This workshop is not recommended if you're currently undergoing any aggressive medication or have had any recent injectables (must allow 3 weeks minimum, check with your practitioner), suffer from cystic acne or any contagious skin conditions. You're most welcome to join for the knowledge and to work on parts of your face that are not under stress.</span></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\" fontscheme-block=\"1\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><strong fontscheme=\"1\">Grab your ticket and step into 2026 feeling refreshed, radiant and ready to shine. </strong></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\" bold-block=\"true\" fontscheme-block=\"1\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><span fontscheme=\"1\">Please note. During the Winter months, the Bishops Park gate to Fulham Pier will be closed from 6.30pm, and Bishop&rsquo;s Park itself will close at 7pm. Those joining us for events should use the Thames Path pathway from Stevenage Road to access Fulham Pier. Use what3words &lsquo;stars.boat.faster&rsquo; to guide you to the pathway.</span></div>",
    "event_summary": "Lift, tone and glow: learn the facial ritual your skin loves.",
