    "event_title": "Krystal Roxx presents Love2Dance - Sober Rave",
    "event_description": "<p><br /></p>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><span fontscheme=\"2\">Step into the ultimate feel-good afternoon as DJ and wellness champion</span><strong fontscheme=\"2\"> Krystal Roxx</strong><span fontscheme=\"2\"> brings her high-vibe </span><strong fontscheme=\"2\">Love2Dance sober rave</strong><span fontscheme=\"2\"> to Fulham Pier. </span></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\" fontscheme-block=\"2\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><span fontscheme=\"2\">Expect an atmosphere that&rsquo;s electric yet uplifting, where the music hits hard and the energy stays high from the very first beat. Think festival-level joy in a space designed for connection, movement and letting go. Whether you&rsquo;re a seasoned raver or simply craving a different kind of release this is your invitation to move freely and reset your mindset.</span></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\" fontscheme-block=\"2\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><span fontscheme=\"2\">We&rsquo;ll be serving a selection of mocktails and non-alcoholic refreshments, crafted to keep you hydrated, energised and fully in the moment. With the river as your backdrop and Fulham Pier&rsquo;s signature feel-good spirit in the air, it&rsquo;s an afternoon made for shaking off stress and stepping into your brightest self.</span></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\" fontscheme-block=\"2\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><span fontscheme=\"2\">Please note. During the Winter months, the Bishops Park gate to Fulham Pier will be closed from 6.30pm, and Bishop&rsquo;s Park itself will close at 7pm. Those joining us for events should use the Thames Path pathway from Stevenage Road to access Fulham Pier. Use what3words &lsquo;stars.boat.faster&rsquo; to guide you to the pathway.</span></div>",
