    "event_title": "Orange Box Secret Film Screenings",
    "event_description": "<p><br /></p>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><strong fontscheme=\"2\">Step into the unknown with Orange Box Monthly Secret Screenings.</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\" bold-block=\"true\" fontscheme-block=\"2\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><span fontscheme=\"2\">Shhh&hellip; it&rsquo;s a secret. </span></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\" fontscheme-block=\"2\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><span fontscheme=\"2\">Each month, we pick a theme but the movie? That stays under wraps until the lights go down.</span></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\" fontscheme-block=\"2\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><span fontscheme=\"2\">Expect cult classics, feel-good throwbacks, bold visuals and unforgettable moments carefully curated to match the vibe of the night. Will it make you laugh, cry or dance in your seat? You&rsquo;ll only find out when the reel starts rolling.</span></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\" fontscheme-block=\"2\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><span fontscheme=\"2\">Mysterious. Exciting. Totally Fulham Pier.</span></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\" fontscheme-block=\"2\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><span fontscheme=\"2\">Oh, and did we mention? Every ticket comes with complimentary popcorn. Because every great secret deserves snacks.</span></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\" fontscheme-block=\"2\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><span fontscheme=\"2\">Why not join us for some food and drink before, during, or after? You&rsquo;ll find casual bites and drinks in Riverside Market, from burgers, to Butter Chicken, Pizza to Cocktails. And if you&rsquo;re looking for something more refined, why not book a table at Brasserie Constance, our seasonal, modern British Brasserie by Adam Byatt.</span></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\" fontscheme-block=\"2\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><span fontscheme=\"2\">Please note. During the Winter months, the Bishops Park gate to Fulham Pier will be closed from 6.30pm, and Bishop&rsquo;s Park itself will close at 7pm. Those joining us for events should use the Thames Path pathway from Stevenage Road to access Fulham Pier. Use what3words &lsquo;stars.boat.faster&rsquo; to guide you to the pathway.</span></div>",
    "event_summary": "Step into a night of mystery, mood and cinematic delight.",
