    "event_description": "<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Dancercise at Fulham Pier</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">After a tough three years of intense professional training and work in the dance and musical theatre industry, Anna rediscovered the joy of moving simply to feel good. No competing for that job, no professional pressure, just dancing because it&rsquo;s good for the soul!</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Anna&rsquo;s classes are a safe space where you&rsquo;re encouraged to lose your inhibitions and strip exercise back to that freeing feeling of dancing when no one is watching. These classes involve plenty of Anna making a fool out of herself with air guitars, shimmying, sweating and sensational playlists (if she does say so herself) and so much heart.</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Let&rsquo;s recognise the importance of enjoying judgement free exercise and dance together - please come along for an hour of boogying.</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Every Wednesday 12:30pm - 1:30pm</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Important info:</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Absolutely no previous dance experience is required</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Bring a water bottle (no other equipment required)</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Comfortable trainers or bare feet are recommended</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">This class is open to all ages</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Please arrive five minutes before the start of class and make your way to the FP reception</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Variety of food available to purchase in Riverside Market before, during and after the event.</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">For more info, follow @dancercisewithanna on Instagram!</div>",
