    "event_title": "Terrarium Making Workshop ",
    "event_description": "<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Begin the new year with a moment of calm at Fulham Pier as you reconnect with nature through a mindful, hands-on Terrarium-Making Workshop.</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Set against the serene riverside backdrop, this session blends creativity, mindfulness and the simple pleasure of crafting something beautiful. Guided by an expert from Jar &amp; Fern, you&rsquo;ll design and build your own bespoke terrarium, using natural materials and lush greenery to create a miniature ecosystem that brings a touch of tranquility into your home.</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Tickets are &pound;35 per person &amp; include a complimentary drink - with a choice of alcoholic or non-alcoholic.&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Why not extend your visit with something to eat or drink before, during, or after the workshop? Riverside Market offers casual bites, from burgers to butter chicken, pizza to cocktails. For something more refined, book a table at Brasserie Constance, our seasonal modern British brasserie by Adam Byatt.</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Please note: During the winter months, the Bishops Park gate to Fulham Pier closes at 6.30pm, and Bishop&rsquo;s Park closes at 7pm. Guests attending evening events should access Fulham Pier via the Thames Path, approached from Stevenage Road. Use what3words &lsquo;stars.boat.faster&rsquo; to guide you to the pathway.</div>",
