    "event_description": "<p><br /></p>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">This January, laughter is all you need to get through the longest month! Comedy Box returns to Orange Box at Fulham Pier with a star-studded line up, promising belly laughs, brilliant acts and a buzzing atmosphere from start to finish.&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">\n<p><strong>Michael Odewale⁠</strong><br />As seen on BBC's Live At The Apollo and Mock the Week ⁠<br />⁠<br /><strong>Eli Hart⁠</strong><br />Winner of the 2025 BBC New Comedy Awards⁠<br />⁠<br /><strong>Valeria Vulpe⁠</strong><br />Winner of Ricky Gervais' nationwide 2025 Competition 'Dutch Barn Spirit of Comedy'⁠<br />⁠<br /><strong>Rich Wilson - Compere</strong> ⁠<br />A seasoned pro and audience favourite, Rich is known for his warm storytelling, raucous energy and brilliant observations. He&rsquo;s performed all over the world and hosts the hit mental-health podcast Insane in the Men Brain.⁠</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Tickets are on sale now - grab yours before they&rsquo;re gone!</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Over 18s only.</div>",
