    "event_description": "<p data-start=\"727\" data-end=\"763\">Immerse yourself in uplifting sounds this Wellness Month as Sherry Jazz returns to Fulham Pier for a soulful, feel-good performance.</p>\n<p>Let the smooth melodies, warm rhythms and energising atmosphere elevate your mood and bring a moment of calm, connection and joy to your January. A perfect way to unwind, reset, and nourish your wellbeing through the power of live music.</p>\n<p data-start=\"727\" data-end=\"763\"><strong>Free to attend.</strong></p>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Why not extend your visit with something to eat or drink before, during, or after the workshop? Riverside Market offers casual bites, from burgers to butter chicken, pizza to cocktails. For something more refined, book a table at Brasserie Constance, our seasonal modern British brasserie by Adam Byatt.</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Please note: During the winter months, the Bishops Park gate to Fulham Pier closes at 6.30pm, and Bishop&rsquo;s Park closes at 7pm. Guests attending evening events should access Fulham Pier via the Thames Path, approached from Stevenage Road. Use what3words &lsquo;stars.boat.faster&rsquo; to guide you to the pathway.</div>",
