    "event_description": "<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Experience deep relaxation and energetic renewal with our Angelic Reiki sessions at Fulham Pier with Sacred Tones. A gentle yet profoundly transformative healing practice that helps you release old energies, dissolve emotional blocks and<span>&nbsp;</span><span>move forward with clarity and power.</span><span>&nbsp;</span>Guided by Pauline, an Angelic Reiki Master Teacher and holistic practitioner; each session channels pure, high-frequency energy from the Angelic Realm to support your body, mind, and spirit.</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Whether you&rsquo;re beginning your wellness journey or looking to deepen your self-care practice; this calming, uplifting experience offers a beautiful way to pause, breathe and nurture your whole self this January.</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><span>Tickets are &pound;15 per person.</span></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><br /></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Why not extend your visit with something to eat or drink before, during, or after the workshop? Riverside Market offers casual bites, from&nbsp;salads to burgers , pizza to cocktails. For something more refined, book a table at Brasserie Constance, our seasonal modern British brasserie by Adam Byatt.</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Please note: During the winter months, the Bishops Park gate to Fulham Pier closes at 6.30pm, and Bishop&rsquo;s Park closes at 7pm. Guests attending evening events should access Fulham Pier via the Thames Path, approached from Stevenage Road. Use what3words &lsquo;stars.boat.faster&rsquo; to guide you to the pathway.</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
