    "event_title": "The Complete Confidence Experience: Rhythm & Radiance",
    "event_description": "<p><br /></p>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><strong fontscheme=\"2\">Rhythm &amp; Radiance: Your 2026 Confidence Reboot</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\" fontscheme-block=\"2\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><span fontscheme=\"2\">Step into the new year feeling grounded, clear and </span><em fontscheme=\"2\">fully in your power. </em></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\" fontscheme-block=\"2\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><span fontscheme=\"2\">Rhythm &amp; Radiance is a one-day immersive experience designed to reset your mind, reconnect you with your body and boost your confidence from the inside out. No pressure, no hype just real neuroscience-backed transformation.</span></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\" fontscheme-block=\"2\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><span fontscheme=\"2\">Across the day, you&rsquo;ll move through a series of experiential sessions that blend breathwork, movement, mindset tools and joyful self-expression. All created to help you walk into 2026 with clarity, energy and a strong sense of direction.</span></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\" fontscheme-block=\"2\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><strong fontscheme=\"2\">What you&rsquo;ll experience:</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\" fontscheme-block=\"2\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><strong fontscheme=\"2\">Confidence in your body</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><span fontscheme=\"2\">Breathwork, guided movement and mind &amp; body practices to calm your nervous system, release tension and help you feel grounded, energised and deeply connected to yourself.</span></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\" fontscheme-block=\"2\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><strong fontscheme=\"2\">Confidence in your mind</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><span fontscheme=\"2\">Future life hypnosis, practical neuroscience and mindset tools that shift you out of self-doubt and into self-belief. Equipping you a mental foundation you can rely on every day.</span></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\" fontscheme-block=\"2\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><strong fontscheme=\"2\">Confidence in your joy with Miss Fallon Dee</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><span fontscheme=\"2\">A liberating movement session to shake off inhibition, reconnect to joy and express yourself freely. Followed by Fallon&rsquo;s iconic dressing-up box and disco-house beats to lift the room (and your confidence) even higher.</span></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\" fontscheme-block=\"2\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><strong fontscheme=\"2\">Why it works: </strong></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\" fontscheme-block=\"2\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><span fontscheme=\"2\">This day blends body, brain and being the three elements that truly shape confidence. Expect tools you can use long after the event, a calmer nervous system and the kind of clarity that comes from reconnecting with yourself on every level.</span></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\" fontscheme-block=\"2\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><strong fontscheme=\"2\">What you&rsquo;ll leave with:</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\" fontscheme-block=\"2\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><span fontscheme=\"2\">- A clear vision and direction for your 2026</span></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><span fontscheme=\"2\">- A regulated, steady nervous system</span></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><span fontscheme=\"2\">- Daily tools to manage self-doubt and internal pressure</span></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><span fontscheme=\"2\">- A renewed sense of confidence you can actually feel</span></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><span fontscheme=\"2\"></span><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><span fontscheme=\"2\">Buy tickets <a href=\"Rhythm &amp; Radiance: Your 2026 Confidence Reboot  Step into the new year feeling grounded, clear and fully in your power.  Rhythm