    "event_title": "Pier Pups Wellness Day",
    "event_description": "<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">\n<p data-start=\"153\" data-end=\"248\">Celebrate with a day of relaxation, joy, and connection for you and your furry best friend!&nbsp;</p>\n<p data-start=\"250\" data-end=\"356\">Enjoy a thoughtfully curated series of experiences designed to nurture wellbeing for both humans and pups.&nbsp;</p>\n<p data-start=\"250\" data-end=\"356\"><br /></p>\n<p data-start=\"358\" data-end=\"539\"><strong data-start=\"361\" data-end=\"389\">Dog Yoga&nbsp;</strong><br data-start=\"389\" data-end=\"392\" /> Unwind with two gentle, 1-hour sessions combining soothing stretches and calming sound therapy. A perfect way to relax, bond, and breathe with your dog by your side.</p>\n<p data-start=\"358\" data-end=\"539\">Sessions available for booking:</p>\n<p data-start=\"358\" data-end=\"539\">Session 1 - 11:30am until 12:30pm</p>\n<p data-start=\"358\" data-end=\"539\">Session 2 - 1:15pm until 2:15pm</p>\n<p data-start=\"358\" data-end=\"539\"><strong>Ticket is valid for one dog and owner.&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"358\" data-end=\"539\"><strong></strong><br /></p>\n<p data-start=\"358\" data-end=\"539\"><strong></strong><br /></p>\n<p data-start=\"358\" data-end=\"539\"><strong data-start=\"544\" data-end=\"570\">Dog Photography Studio</strong><br data-start=\"570\" data-end=\"573\" /> Capture the magic of your relationship with professional pet photography. Take home beautiful portraits that celebrate your unique bond. Ticket is valid for one dog and owner.&nbsp;</p>\n<p data-start=\"358\" data-end=\"539\">Sessions available for booking:</p>\n<p data-start=\"358\" data-end=\"539\">Session 1 - 12:30pm until 1:30pm</p>\n<p data-start=\"358\" data-end=\"539\">Session 2 - 1:30pm until 2:30pm</p>\n<p data-start=\"358\" data-end=\"539\">Session 3 - 2:30pm until 3:30pm</p>\n<p data-start=\"358\" data-end=\"539\">Session 4 - 3:30pm until 4:30pm</p>\n<p data-start=\"358\" data-end=\"539\"><strong>You will receive a queue ticket for your chosen hourly slot upon arrival. Each ticket is for a 15 minute shoot which includes 1 digital image.</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"358\" data-end=\"539\"><strong></strong><br /></p>\n<p data-start=\"358\" data-end=\"539\"><strong></strong><br /></p>\n<p data-start=\"711\" data-end=\"886\"><strong data-start=\"714\" data-end=\"737\">Doggy Retail Treats</strong><br data-start=\"737\" data-end=\"740\" /> Browse our curated selection of pet goodies, including dog beer, Fulham Pier&ndash;branded bowls, and a wide variety of tasty treats your pup will love.</p>\n<p data-start=\"888\" data-end=\"1025\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Join us for a mindful, playful, and memorable experience that celebrates wellbeing for the whole family, two-legged and four-legged alike.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Why not extend your visit with something to eat or drink before, during, or after the workshop? Riverside Market offers casual bites, from burgers to butter chicken, pizza to cocktails. For something more refined, book a table at Brasserie Constance, our seasonal modern British brasserie by Adam Byatt.</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><br /></div>\n</div>",
